	(text
		"CRL-TRK-2W-01  AIS-140 two-wheeler tracker  -  60 x 45 mm, 4-layer 1.6 mm (JLC04161H-7628)\n\nVEHICLE 9-36 V -> F1/D1 -> LM74700 ideal diode -> pi filter -> LM5164 buck 5.0 V -+-> BQ24074 power path -> VSYS 3.0-4.4 V\nUSB-C VBUS 5 V ---------------------------------------------------------------+     |-> TPS22917 -> SIM7080G VBAT\n18650 1S pack (PCM + NTC) <-> BQ24074 BAT  (LC709203F fuel gauge, VBAT/2 ADC)        |-> TLV75733 -> +3V3 (always on)\n                                                                                       -> TPS22917 -> +3V3_GNSS\n\nESP32-S3-WROOM-1 <-UART(1.8 V via TXS0108E)-> SIM7080G LTE-M/NB-IoT  -> U.FL -> flex LTE antenna\n                 <-UART---------------------> NEO-F10N L1/L5 + NavIC  -> U.FL -> active L1/L5 patch\n                 <-I2C--> IIM-42652 IMU, LC709203F gauge, RV-3028 RTC     <-SPI-> W25Q128 log flash\n                 <-GPIO-> IGN, PANIC, DIN1, AIN1, DOUT1 (relay), LEDs, Tag-Connect JTAG, USB-C\n\nSleep budget (ignition off, modem PSM, GNSS backup): ~110 uA from the pack - see 04_docs/POWER_TREE.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 160 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c8c95ed2-ab9e-5838-8601-03362fec4d4b")
	)
